name":"中山","place_name_jianti_auto":"中山","start_index":157,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf8b-db0e-11ef-8a29-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"光狼","place_name_jianti_auto":"光狼","start_index":162,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf8c-db0e-11ef-8467-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上郡","start_index":170,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf8d-db0e-11ef-9ec5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九原","place_name_jianti_auto":"九原","start_index":173,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf8e-db0e-11ef-9793-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲中","place_name_jianti_auto":"云中","start_index":176,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf8f-db0e-11ef-8b7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","place_note":"都邯郸，河北邯郸","start_index":184,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf90-db0e-11ef-b452-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"光狼","place_name_jianti_auto":"光狼","start_index":188,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf91-db0e-11ef-9bac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"光狼城","place_name_jianti_auto":"光狼城","place_note":"山西高平西","start_index":207,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf92-db0e-11ef-aee2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱曰：地志不載光狼城，蓋屬趙國。史記正義曰：光狼故城，在澤州高平縣西二十里。康曰：本中山地，趙武靈王取之，其地在代。余考史以代光狼城聯而書之，康以爲其地在代可也。又云本中山地；中山與代舊爲兩國，代在山之陰，中山在山之陽；旣云在代，不當又云本中山地。如康意，抑以爲光狼本代地，趙襄子滅代而中山侵有光狼地；武靈王旣滅中山，始有光狼之地。白起自上郡、九原、雲中下兵，始能敗趙軍，取光狼。史旣不先序其兵行之路，後又無考，光狼城之所，闕疑可也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐曰：地志不载光狼城，盖属赵国。史记正义曰：光狼故城，在泽州高平县西二十里。康曰：本中山地，赵武灵王取之，其地在代。余考史以代光狼城联而书之，康以为其地在代可也。又云本中山地；中山与代旧为两国，代在山之阴，中山在山之阳；既云在代，不当又云本中山地。如康意，抑以为光狼本代地，赵襄子灭代而中山侵有光狼地；武灵王既灭中山，始有光狼之地。白起自上郡、九原、云中下兵，始能败赵军，取光狼。史既不先序其兵行之路，后又无考，光狼城之所，阙疑可也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf6f-db0e-11ef-b95d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf97-db0e-11ef-894e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汧縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"汧县","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf98-db0e-11ef-b4fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大隴山","place_name_jianti_auto":"大陇山","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf99-db0e-11ef-a620-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴坻","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇坻","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf9a-db0e-11ef-803e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf9b-db0e-11ef-9b7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀戎","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀戎","place_note":"甘肃甘谷县","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf9c-db0e-11ef-ae2f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"䝠戎","place_name_jianti_auto":"䝠戎","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf9d-db0e-11ef-96d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"氐","place_name_jianti_auto":"氐","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf9e-db0e-11ef-b95f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf9f-db0e-11ef-bc35-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","place_note":"都咸阳，陕西省咸阳市","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8cafcfa0-db0e-11ef-870b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴西郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇西郡","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8cafcfa1-db0e-11ef-8b54-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"扶風汧縣之西有大隴山，名隴坻，上者七日方越。自隴以西，本冀戎、䝠戎、氐、羌之地，秦累世攘拓，以其地置隴西郡。錯，七各翻，又倉故翻。汧，苦堅翻。䝠，戶官翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"扶风汧县之西有大陇山，名陇坻，上者七日方越。自陇以西，本冀戎、䝠戎、氐、羌之地，秦累世攘拓，以其地置陇西郡。错，七各翻，又仓故翻。汧，苦坚翻。䝠，户官翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf96-db0e-11ef-bc53-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8cafcfa3-db0e-11ef-9795-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","place_note":"四川成都","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8cafcfa4-db0e-11ef-89f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴郡","sta